AdoaXigl3P35hHerrd8tRXLCWGVpL7ifFiHhvJY7wQCEQ59PpLZqWV9ULalCH8SpzMc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGTcjjJTnWfuF6TTqjGYFA06bZUYUzfGZprqxARwMBTlw&oe=6A972E00"}, {"file_name": "com.leafandlight.carcrasharena-20260810-081754-2560x1440.png", "id": "1369825404525766", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_1369825407859099_4984911118875579209_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WKcZygYU2BIQ7kNvwGRGoUz&_nc_oc=Adqa8Rwbd6Kf00gBO3M-BmQEwQfrNpuotSQ-ixcuyfKXCayzlCu5vayhZfg0gyYz-QE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGqTA_0Z4Ml2ncVovAbuxhPTN2Xq6o1vZfEoUUTai9o2g&oe=6A9738AC"}, {"file_name": "com.leafandlight.carcrasharena-20260810-081730-2560x1440.png", "id": "2213113889537634", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_2213113892870967_7759255486201490021_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lp85fCwnnxQQ7kNvwF8Q67_&_nc_oc=AdrRG2tbN57JT1Uipx287Ix2r__F0DqKH1GtYnD247NLcEvE-2O-SjVzVgjMm5bcPsE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGceaYGn5yxh7sU-HM0-sYSc8aRvS_dTdcdqNIJW4BONA&oe=6A973DCB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Image Sequence_044_0009.png", "id": "1303495935267871", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_1303495938601204_6101607894595342530_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p1RlyivsYi8Q7kNvwE98Vln&_nc_oc=Adr4U2U9iiJRD9vJMOGb_FX8LOEmTmUCnZDGNvJ3LACnHRZSbHvZMdbrB-hWNd50UUk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH3l9eAntwsVulZ0zKycXUG2vRAcMHyzze9eUx4J3Z-LA&oe=6A973EF6"}, "display_name": "Car Crash Arena", "keywords": ["destruction", "VR", "Race", "MachineGun", "Stylized"], "long_description": "WELCOME TO DEADLOCK CITY\n\nEnter Deadlock City's vehicle-combat tournament, broadcast by Barnaby Boone, owner and voice of Arena Radio.\n\nChoose your car, step into the VR cockpit, and survive escalating waves of rival drivers, zombies, and the dangerous Agents of Chaos. Ram enemies into traps, fire mounted weapons, use nitro, dodge bombs and cranes, and stay out of the acid.\n\n{1323862079544884}\n\nBUILD YOUR COMBAT CAR\n\nUnlock vehicles and equip spikes, guns, flares, damage boosts, and survival upgrades. Create a build focused on damage, control, or endurance.\n\n{1594360845441526}\n\nCLIMB THE LEADERBOARDS\n\nFight through short, replayable runs, improve your score, and compete on Global and Friends leaderboards.\n\n{28962886803299796}\n\nFEATURES\n\n\u2022 First-person VR cockpit driving\n\u2022 Arcade demolition and vehicle combat\n\u2022 Rival drivers, Agents of Chaos, and zombies\n\u2022 Weapons, nitro, upgrades, traps, and moving hazards\n\u2022 Physics-driven crashes, flips, and explosions\n\u2022 Seated or standing play\n\u2022 Co-op mode coming soon\n\n{1998673274183767}\n{1556336889137256}\n\nCar Crash Arena is in Early Access and continues to grow through updates, including new arenas, Racing Mode, vehicles, upgrades, and gameplay improvements.\n\n{1640774564265454}\n\nWelcome to Deadlock City. Survive the tournament and earn your place among its champions.\n\n{1514434543770239}\n{1084955644221076}\n{907329338589421}\n", "short_description": "Welcome to Deadlock City!\n\nI\u2019m Barnaby Boone, proud owner\u2014and loudest voice\u2014of the greatest Arena Radio station in the world! Or, well... what\u2019s left of it! Ahahaha!\n\nNow step right up, champion, and let\u2019s put your skills to the test!\n\nOut there, you\u2019ll face other drivers just like you\u2014your rivals\u2014as well as the fearsome Agents of Chaos! Ahahaha! Those lunatics are dangerous, so keep your eyes open!\n\nOh, and of course... if you spot any zombies wandering around, just run \u2019em over! AHAHAHA!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://leafandlight.github.io/car-crash-arena-site/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publi